ent_transcripts/2023/23-250_9o6b.pdf","page_label":"file page 9, lines 11-19"}]}],"caption":"Becerra, Sec. of H&HS v. San Carlos Apache Tribe","case_history":[{"changed_at":"2026-08-29T20:06:15.630584Z","explanation":"An official oral-argument transcript was verified.","status":"argued"},{"changed_at":"2026-08-29T20:06:15.662892Z","explanation":"An official oral-argument transcript was verified.","status":"argued"},{"changed_at":"2026-08-29T23:55:57.238226Z","explanation":"An official Court opinion was verified.","status":"decided"}],"case_status":"decided","dek":"The San Carlos Apache Tribe seeks full reimbursement for indirect costs. The Department of Health and Human Services argues the law limits this payment.","dek_sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 102, lines 53-47","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2023/23-250_9o6b.pdf","page_label":"file page 102, lines 53-47"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 43, lines 47-29","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2023/23-250_9o6b.pdf","page_label":"file page 43, lines 47-29"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 5, lines 23-21","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2023/23-250_9o6b.pdf","page_label":"file page 5, lines 23-21"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 69, lines 15-15","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2023/23-250_9o6b.pdf","page_label":"file page 69, lines 15-15"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 82, lines 15-15","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2023/23-250_9o6b.pdf","page_label":"file page 82, lines 15-15"}],"dispositions":[],"lates